=== FV ===
Commands:
  create   Create a feature view from one or more feature groups.
  delete   Delete a feature view and its training datasets.
  get      Look up a single feature vector from the online store.
  info     Show metadata for a single feature view.
  lineage  Show upstream and downstream lineage for a feature view.
  list     List every feature view in the active project's feature store.
  read     Batch-read from the offline feature store.
=== TD ===
Commands:
  compute  Materialize a training dataset from a feature view.
  delete   Delete a training dataset (single version or all).
  lineage  Show lineage for training datasets of a feature view.
  list     List training dataset versions generated from a feature view.
  read     Retrieve a previously materialized training dataset.
